  "body": "336 Pinecrest Drive, Gulf Harbour, Whangaparaoa 0930\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\nProperty Overview\r\n \r\nAddress: 336 Pinecrest Drive, Gulf Harbour, Whangaparaoa 0930\r\nLand Area: 1,888m² (more or less)\r\nTitle: Freehold\r\nA Rare Opportunity on the Peninsula\r\nPerched on a generous 1,888m² elevated freehold site with stunning outlooks over Okoromai Bay, this is one of the largest and most desirable sections in Gulf Harbour's most prestigious pocket.\r\nSurrounded by multi-million-dollar architectural residences and completed high-end designer homes, your future build is protected by quality neighbourhood covenants - ensuring your investment sits among the very best Whangaparaoa has to offer.\r\n Key Features\r\nGenerous 1,888m² Freehold Site - Expansive elevated land with breathtaking bay views\r\nProtected Investment - Surrounded by high-end designer homes with quality neighbourhood covenants\r\nPremium Coastal Lifestyle - Minutes to regional parks, golf courses, beaches & Gulf Harbour Marina\r\nEasy CBD Commute - Ferry terminal nearby for a scenic trip to Auckland CBD\r\nFuture-Proof Connectivity - The Penlink highway, currently under construction, will provide a second access route to the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, dramatically improving road connections to Auckland's northern motorway network\r\nSerious Seller will Meets the Market\r\nLocation Highlights\r\nGulf Harbour Marina - One of Auckland's premier marinas, just minutes away\r\nGolf Courses - Championship courses within easy reach\r\nBeaches & Parks - Shakespear Regional Park, Hobbs Bay and pristine beaches nearby\r\nFerry Terminal - Direct ferry to Auckland CBD for effortless commuting\r\nGulf Harbour Village - Cafés, supermarket and local amenities close by\r\nPenlink Highway - Under construction, set to transform access to the peninsula\r\nAct Now This is a rare chance to secure one of the largest elevated sections in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal communities. Serious seller meets the market - don't miss out.\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.",
